"""Validate encounter balance for a solo cyberpunk 5e campaign.

Usage:
  ./validate-encounter --level 1 --difficulty hard --enemies "ganger:1/4" "street-punk:1/8"
  ./validate-encounter --level 1 --difficulty medium --enemies "security-drone:1/8"
  ./validate-encounter --level 3 --difficulty hard --enemies "arasaka-guard:1"
  ./validate-encounter --level 1 --enemies "ncpd-officer:1/2"  (defaults to hard)

Arguments:
  --level N         Player character level (required)
  --difficulty D    Target difficulty: easy, medium, hard, deadly (default: hard)
  --enemies CR...   One or more enemies as "name:CR" (CR can be 0, 1/8, 1/4, 1/2, or integer)
